 and adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay encompasses different categories: work, training, romance, and management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat features both turn-based and action mechanics.</p>","developers":["gm_ok"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104010/21e5882076d0770eca92cfb6901fc9990819acef/header.jpg?t=1762245351","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104010/2029044137/04e0a8057a271d790356c42ce90c83946715169f/1762136241/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762245220","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104010/2029044137/04e0a8057a271d790356c42ce90c83946715169f/1762136241/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762245220","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104010/2029044137/04e0a8057a271d790356c42ce90c83946715169f/1762136241/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762245220","id":257218606,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218606/movie480.mp4?t=1762245220","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218606/movie_max.mp4?t=1762245220"},"name":"Red Moon World","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257218606/1d00d65e79bb85ed8c464f04910df2737d70abdb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762245220","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218606/movie480.webm?t=1762245220","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218606/movie_max.webm?t=1762245220"}}],"name":"\u7ea2\u6708\u4e16\u754c","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 11<br></li><li><strong>Process